WEBVTT

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:07.360
It's been two weeks since
I arrived in the Yagumo region.

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.410
I haven't found any clues about
my mother and father yet, but...

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:14.160
Everyone here has black hair.

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:18.390
Who is that?

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:23.300
Hello.

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:26.870
I am a traveler, and I'm looking for someone.

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:30.310
I would very much like to meet
with the head of the village.

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:31.440
Do you know who that might be?

00:00:31.770 --> 00:00:33.300
Oh, um, h-hello.

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:37.300
You're a traveler? My grandma
is the head of the village!

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:41.270
Really? If it isn't any trouble,
would you show me the way?

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:42.310
Oh! Yes.

00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:46.830
Sayo, what are you doing?
You're gonna get left behind.

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:48.310
Wait, Miss Ruri!

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:23.700
Grandma!

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:26.880
You have a visitor!

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:29.450
A visitor who is dressed
quite strangely, I see.

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:33.290
I'm pleased to meet you. I am called Rio.

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:36.780
Madame, I've come because I was
hoping to ask you about something.

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:39.290
Is that so. You're very polite, aren't you?

00:02:39.290 --> 00:02:41.050
Are you from some other country?

00:02:41.050 --> 00:02:44.320
Yes. I've traveled through many lands.

00:02:44.320 --> 00:02:48.440
I see. I'm Yuba. What's your business here?

00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:50.510
Actually, I'm looking for someone.

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:54.550
I came to this village because I've heard that

00:02:54.550 --> 00:02:57.070
you knew most people in
this area, Madame Yuba.

00:02:57.440 --> 00:03:00.560
This seems like it's going to be
an involved conversation. Come in.

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:01.470
This way.

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:03.150
Thank you for having me.

00:03:05.440 --> 00:03:08.130
I heard that my mom and dad lived here

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:11.820
in the Yagumo region over
fifteen years ago, but...

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:15.090
I see. And what were your parents' names?

00:03:15.450 --> 00:03:17.090
Their names were Zen and Ayame.

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:19.340
Did you say Zen and Ayame?

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:20.970
Have you heard of them?

00:03:21.290 --> 00:03:24.260
Ruri, Sayo, go back to your work.

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:26.350
What? Why?

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:30.180
You shouldn't poke your nose into
other people's personal histories.

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:32.350
Fine. Just when it was getting interesting.

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:33.650
Let's go, Sayo.

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:34.870
Y-Yes.

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:39.360
If you would give me a little more detail...

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:44.130
Yes. I heard that they were
both born in the Yagumo region.

00:03:44.670 --> 00:03:47.650
My father died before I was
old enough to know him.

00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:50.750
I lived a peaceful, happy life
with my mother, but...

00:03:51.550 --> 00:03:54.250
My mother died, too, when I was five.

00:03:54.970 --> 00:03:58.750
Coming to the Yagumo region was
something my mom and I promised to do.

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:04.260
When you're bigger, I'll take you there.
It's a place called Yagumo.

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:06.760
Really? You promised, okay?

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:08.340
Yes, I promise.

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:13.700
As I traveled, I started to think that
if I could find where they lived,

00:04:14.010 --> 00:04:17.060
I'd like to make graves for them.

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:21.180
The least I can do for them is hold
a proper memorial in their homeland.

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:23.610
There's no mistake.

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:26.280
Both of them are people I knew.

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:29.010
And you do have the look of them.

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:32.490
Forgive my rudeness, but how
did you know my parents?

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:33.970
I'm Zen's mother.

00:04:33.970 --> 00:04:34.660
What?

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:36.750
Your grandmother.

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:38.010
My father's...

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:40.520
Thank you for coming here.

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:43.760
But the truth is, I don't
know what to tell you.

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:46.640
We already have graves for both of them.

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:47.610
What?

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:53.050
These are Mother and Father's graves.

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:54.640
That's right.

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:57.020
Would it be all right if I paid my respects?

00:04:58.100 --> 00:04:59.150
Yes.

00:05:01.850 --> 00:05:05.450
I finally made it here, Mother, Father.

00:05:06.390 --> 00:05:11.450
Both of them had to leave this country
in secret for certain reasons.

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:14.330
There was no possibility that
they would come home,

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:16.460
so those of us who knew of
the true circumstances

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:18.960
made graves for the two of them here.

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:20.940
What was the reason?

00:05:21.850 --> 00:05:25.660
I'm sorry, but I cannot
be the one to tell you.

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:28.970
But the time may come that
I am able to talk about it.

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:32.930
What do you think? Will you live here
in the village until that time comes?

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:35.030
Would that be possible?

00:05:35.030 --> 00:05:38.350
Yes. You're my grandson, after all.

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:41.110
Grandchildren should
never stand on manners.

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:42.650
Grandchild...

00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:48.700
All of my relatives have died. Right now,
it's only Ruri and I living together.

00:05:49.130 --> 00:05:52.630
Ruri is Zen's older brother's
daughter. Your cousin.

00:05:52.630 --> 00:05:54.760
She's fifteen now.

00:05:54.760 --> 00:05:57.300
She's one year older than I am, then.

00:05:57.980 --> 00:06:01.750
Are you that young? You seem quite mature.

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:03.690
I'm nothing like that.

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:06.720
Shall we head back?

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:08.880
Madame Yuba?

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:11.920
May I stay here a little longer?

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:15.580
Yes. But stop addressing me so formally.

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:18.660
Mistress... Yuba.

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:21.400
Better. Don't stay out too late.

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:25.850
I'll keep your lineage hidden
from the others for a while.

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:35.510
Excuse the intrusion!

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:37.870
Honestly, Rio!

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:39.820
What took you so long? I'm starving!

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:41.880
Welcome back, Rio.

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:43.310
Hurry up! Let's eat!

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:44.750
Yes.

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:52.390
Good morning.

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:54.760
Morning. You're up early, aren't you?

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:57.330
I'll start helping with things
around the village today.

00:06:57.700 --> 00:07:00.340
I thought I'd get breakfast
ready before that.

00:07:00.340 --> 00:07:02.750
I'm very happy to see
that you're so motivated.

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:06.110
Morning, Grandma.

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:07.040
Miss Ruri—

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:09.240
Good morning.

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:11.700
Morning. You...

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:14.380
Did you forget that Rio's here?

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:23.630
Oh, no! What am I doing?!

00:07:25.450 --> 00:07:27.880
Impressive. You're quite skilled.

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:30.670
In that case, I'll ask you to make miso soup.

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:33.320
It looks like we don't
have quite enough water.

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:36.050
Yeah. And Sayo and Shin
are coming today, too.

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:38.870
Rio! Use the water over there.

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:42.060
We refill it every day with spirit arts.

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:45.090
So both of them can use spirit arts.

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:48.070
Hot water would be better
than plain water, right?

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:49.640
Shall I make some?

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:50.330
What?

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:58.010
That's amazing! Rio, you can make
hot water with spirit magic!

00:07:58.010 --> 00:07:59.900
Even Grandma can't do that!

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:04.540
There's a little trick to it.
I can teach you, if you want.

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:05.210
Yes!

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:08.170
Good morning.

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:08.990
Morning!

00:08:08.990 --> 00:08:11.030
Man, I'm starving...

00:08:11.030 --> 00:08:12.420
Good morning.

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:13.890
Good morning.

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:14.930
Who're you?

00:08:15.330 --> 00:08:17.560
Rio and Shin haven't met yet, have they?

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:20.640
This is Sayo's older brother, Shin.
This boy is Rio.

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:22.820
He's the son of a long-time
acquaintance of mine.

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:25.460
I'm called Rio. Pleased to meet you.

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:27.690
Yeah. Nice to meet you.

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:30.270
This is so good!

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:33.200
There's meat in this!

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:35.690
This miso soup is delicious, too!

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:37.950
Rio made everything for us.

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:38.620
What?

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:39.820
Amazing!

00:08:39.820 --> 00:08:43.790
I'm just glad you like it.
If you want, please have more.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:44.680
I want more!

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:48.460
Honestly, Big Brother,
show a little restraint!

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:52.420
Man, it's only morning and I ate so much!

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:56.320
Shin, take Rio to Dola's place.

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:57.920
Huh? Why?

00:08:57.920 --> 00:09:00.850
I was thinking of having Rio be a hunter.

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:03.130
Huh? Him? A hunter?

00:09:03.130 --> 00:09:05.920
Yes. Rio says he can hunt, too.

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:08.540
And Dola said he wanted help, right?

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:12.150
But it's grueling work, you know?
Does he have the stamina?

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:15.240
He's built pretty delicately.

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:16.730
When you want to make hot water,

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:19.420
He'll be fine. He's strong enough to have
traveled to many countries at his age.

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:19.180
you concentrate your will in
your hand like this, and...

00:09:19.180 --> 00:09:21.240
Really? I see.

00:09:19.420 --> 00:09:21.240
And he can use spirit arts.

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:24.480
Even I can use something
like the spirit arts.

00:09:24.480 --> 00:09:27.380
He may be overwhelmingly stronger
than someone like you.

00:09:27.380 --> 00:09:28.210
Bah.

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:30.590
Hey, Rio!

00:09:30.580 --> 00:09:32.020
I'm gonna take you hunting!

00:09:32.020 --> 00:09:34.090
Make sure you don't get in the way!

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:35.390
Big Brother!

00:09:35.390 --> 00:09:39.000
Sir Rio, I'm so sorry. My brother
speaks rather sharply.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:40.070
Not at all.

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:42.890
Would it be all right for
me to leave the rest to you?

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:44.100
Huh? Sure.

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:49.250
Hey, why is it "sir" Rio?

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:49.810
What?

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:53.560
I-I mean, he sort of feels like a noble.

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:55.820
Like someone too high up to be reached...

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:57.820
I see.

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:07.750
It's a lenou bird.

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:09.710
Good job shooting it down, Rio!

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:11.220
Your skills are impressive.

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:14.690
All right, we can't let
him beat us, right, Shin?

00:10:14.690 --> 00:10:15.710
Huh?

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:17.470
I get it already!

00:10:26.320 --> 00:10:27.750
Blast it!

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:31.030
All right, let's head back.
Good job, both of you.

00:10:31.030 --> 00:10:34.300
Today we'll be able to give everyone
in the village more meat than usual.

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:37.210
I didn't manage to take
down a single one, though.

00:10:37.210 --> 00:10:39.700
It was you and Rio that got
these results, Huntmaster.

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:41.600
What are you sulking for?

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:45.230
It was the three of us working
together that got these results.

00:10:45.230 --> 00:10:46.010
Bah.

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:48.400
Sorry.

00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:50.810
I'll talk to him later.

00:10:50.810 --> 00:10:52.930
Can you come help starting tomorrow?

00:10:52.930 --> 00:10:54.780
Yes, you can count on me.

00:10:57.480 --> 00:11:00.010
I got pretty dirty out there.

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:19.790
Discharge.

00:11:30.780 --> 00:11:32.400
What is this thing?

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:35.490
I thought it must be you, Rio!

00:11:35.490 --> 00:11:37.880
I'm sorry. That must have been a shock.

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:39.490
I'll clean it up now.

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:41.470
No, it's fine, but...

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:43.710
Did you make this with spirit arts, too?

00:11:43.710 --> 00:11:45.350
Yes. I wanted to take a bath.

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:46.640
Really?

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:47.260
Huh?

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:50.180
Miss Ruri?

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:52.600
You smell nice, Rio!

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:53.980
Sayo, you come smell, too!

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:56.420
What? No, I-I'm fine!

00:11:56.420 --> 00:11:59.150
Now, now. No need to get so embarrassed!

00:12:04.390 --> 00:12:05.900
What is that smell?

00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:06.940
It's soap.

00:12:06.940 --> 00:12:11.680
Soap? You mean the stuff you wash yourself
and clothes and things with? That soap?

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:14.750
Sir Rio, you can make soap, too?

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:16.530
Amazing...

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:19.800
What is this thing?

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:23.840
Big Brother! Sir Rio made it
for us! He says it's a bath!

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:24.900
A bath?

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:28.810
There goes the outsider
trying to score points.

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:33.060
You really are rude.
Rio, pay no attention to him.

00:12:33.530 --> 00:12:37.140
Miss Ruri is right. Big Brother, that was mean!

00:12:37.140 --> 00:12:41.300
Sayo, not you, too? Don't go getting
all silly over some weakling!

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:43.610
I'm not being silly!

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:45.950
Shin! Rio isn't a weakling!

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:48.860
In spite of his looks,
he's got a lot of muscle!

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:49.450
Right?

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:50.160
Huh?

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:52.450
Y-You... have you no shame?!

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:53.690
Bleh.

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:54.460
Hmph!

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:58.460
Sayo, we're going home.
I came here to pick... you...

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:01.470
Bah!

00:13:28.830 --> 00:13:30.570
The crops turned out well again this year.

00:13:30.570 --> 00:13:33.520
I heard that the tax examiner
will be coming soon.

00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:34.500
Yes.

00:13:35.220 --> 00:13:39.180
Oh, that's right. Given your skills,
I have a favor to ask you.

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:40.000
Yes?

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:42.540
After the annual tribute and our own rations,

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:45.900
the rice that remains is to
be sold in the royal capital.

00:13:45.900 --> 00:13:49.210
Could I ask you to guard the transport team?

00:13:49.210 --> 00:13:50.550
If you think I'm good enough.

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:51.790
That's a great help.

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:53.470
It's a fight!

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:55.600
It's Shin and those guys
from the other village!

00:13:58.820 --> 00:14:02.980
Gon! Who do you think you are
just walking around our village?!

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:06.260
And you're just heading into the
bathing hut like it's nothing!

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:07.110
You've gotta be kidding me!

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:07.950
Huh?

00:14:08.320 --> 00:14:12.300
I'm here as a guest to visit the head
of your village. That should be obvious.

00:14:13.430 --> 00:14:17.750
Ruri... You've grown into quite
the woman since I last saw you.

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:19.460
And behind you is...

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:22.240
Don't look at my little sister
with those filthy eyes!

00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:24.390
Oh, she's your sister, is she?

00:14:24.390 --> 00:14:26.460
Still, she's a stunner.

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:29.050
You...

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:30.430
Shin, don't!

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:33.580
If you punch this guy over these
pathetic taunts, it'll cause problems.

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:36.130
He may be rotten, but he's the son of
the head of the neighboring village!

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:41.170
Gon, why are you here in our village anyway?

00:14:41.170 --> 00:14:43.680
Let me stay at your place, won't you?

00:14:43.680 --> 00:14:44.690
What?

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:48.070
I'm on my way to sell trade
goods in the royal capital.

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:52.990
but unfortunately, my cart broke.
It'll take time to repair.

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:55.640
Then we'll lend you one of our guest huts.

00:14:55.640 --> 00:15:00.340
Hey, now. I might be your husband
one day. That's pretty cold of you.

00:15:00.340 --> 00:15:03.520
D-Don't say weird things
like that! It's disgusting!

00:15:03.520 --> 00:15:07.160
The head of this village
only has you for an heir.

00:15:07.890 --> 00:15:11.520
So I'm saying I'll volunteer
to be your husband.

00:15:11.520 --> 00:15:15.010
You can't be serious!
We villagers will never allow it!

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:15.970
That's right!

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:19.560
Huh? None of you are
Ruri's man, but you're jealous?

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:21.630
What a bunch of sissies.

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:23.100
What did you say?

00:15:23.410 --> 00:15:24.480
Bring it on.

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:25.440
You piece of crap!

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:26.150
Shin!

00:15:31.640 --> 00:15:33.760
In the end, this is all you've got?

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:35.770
Big Brother!

00:15:35.770 --> 00:15:36.990
Stop it!

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:38.500
That's enough!

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:41.730
Old Lady Yuba. It's been a while.

00:15:41.730 --> 00:15:45.030
First, let him go! Talk comes after that.

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:49.340
Big Brother!

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:50.970
Oh, dear.

00:15:53.940 --> 00:15:55.070
I see.

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:58.970
Gon, I apologize for Shin and
the others' misunderstanding.

00:15:59.260 --> 00:16:03.490
But your behavior was imprudent, too.
You went too far.

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:07.810
Tonight, we will lend you a guest
hut at the edge of the village.

00:16:07.810 --> 00:16:10.350
But you are not allowed to
leave it. Do you understand?

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:11.990
Sure thing.

00:16:17.930 --> 00:16:19.120
A newcomer?

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:21.620
He's effeminate. I don't like him.

00:16:28.040 --> 00:16:28.720
Big Bro?

00:16:28.720 --> 00:16:30.420
Oh, dear. Are you all right?

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:31.710
What happened?

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:34.380
I-It's nothing. Let's go.

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:36.750
Man, now my clothes are dirty.

00:16:38.590 --> 00:16:41.180
Everyone just go back home
quietly for today, all right?

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:44.780
I've forbidden them from leaving the hut,
but don't let down your guard!

00:16:44.780 --> 00:16:46.500
Hey, Gran.

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:49.070
Will you let Sayo stay with you for a while?

00:16:49.490 --> 00:16:52.250
The two of us live alone, so...

00:16:52.250 --> 00:16:56.030
I think she'd feel safer
with you and Ruri around.

00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:58.110
Yes. That's no problem.

00:16:58.110 --> 00:16:59.550
Sayo, that's what we'll do.

00:16:59.550 --> 00:17:00.200
Yes, Madame.

00:17:06.060 --> 00:17:07.670
We should go to sleep.

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:08.440
Yes.

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:10.760
Miss Ruri, Miss Sayo...

00:17:10.760 --> 00:17:11.630
Sir Rio...

00:17:11.910 --> 00:17:14.780
Please put this in a corner of your room.

00:17:14.780 --> 00:17:16.090
It's a protective amulet.

00:17:16.440 --> 00:17:17.340
A protective amulet?

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:18.360
It's beautiful!

00:17:18.360 --> 00:17:20.640
Sir Rio, thank you so much!

00:17:22.690 --> 00:17:24.680
That's our big bro for you!

00:17:25.150 --> 00:17:29.040
Of course. I made sure to
bust up the cart really well.

00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:34.670
We can take all day tomorrow
repairing it at our leisure.

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:37.630
The fun comes after that.

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:41.820
Madame Yuba!

00:17:43.010 --> 00:17:44.470
It's been a long time.

00:17:44.470 --> 00:17:46.370
Welcome! Thank you for coming all this way!

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:48.750
Pleased to meet you. I'm called Rio.

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:51.170
I'm called Saga Hayate.

00:17:51.510 --> 00:17:54.010
I'm traveling to all the
villages as tax examiner.

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:56.930
I hope you'll take good
care of my aides, too.

00:18:22.390 --> 00:18:24.790
Watching like that can't possibly be any fun.

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:28.750
Your movement's so pretty,
we couldn't help watching!

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:30.450
It's just simple training.

00:18:30.450 --> 00:18:32.490
No, no, it's really impressive!

00:18:32.490 --> 00:18:34.500
You've done it every day since
you came to the village, right?

00:18:34.810 --> 00:18:37.030
Why did you start martial arts?

00:18:37.030 --> 00:18:38.510
Well...

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:41.530
Even if I die, I'll protect you, Mii-chan!

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:45.180
It's a little embarrassing to say...

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:47.950
What? I want to know even
more now! Right, Sayo?

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:50.680
What? Yes. I'd like to know.

00:18:50.680 --> 00:18:53.240
Well, this is a problem.

00:18:53.240 --> 00:18:55.310
Do you mind if I dress myself?

00:18:55.310 --> 00:18:57.650
Huh? Oh, please go ahead.

00:18:58.380 --> 00:19:00.610
When I was little,
there was a girl I liked...

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:04.340
I wanted to become strong enough
that I could protect her.

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:06.190
Wow, really?

00:19:06.190 --> 00:19:08.030
What is she doing now?

00:19:08.570 --> 00:19:10.410
We're not in contact anymore.

00:19:10.410 --> 00:19:12.880
She might be with someone she loves.

00:19:13.350 --> 00:19:16.380
And I don't know if she even
remembers me in the first place.

00:19:20.330 --> 00:19:22.720
I don't know where she's living, either.

00:19:23.130 --> 00:19:26.490
But if she's alive, then you
might meet again one day.

00:19:26.900 --> 00:19:27.990
Right, Sayo?

00:19:28.420 --> 00:19:29.730
Y-Yes.

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:31.050
That's true.

00:19:31.050 --> 00:19:33.850
Though, right now, I'm training for myself.

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:36.730
That bath was truly wonderful!

00:19:37.130 --> 00:19:38.530
Thank you very much.

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:39.990
I'm glad to hear it.

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:44.370
Miss Ruri, you two should go ahead and
use the bath first. It's getting chilly.

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:45.770
That's true.

00:19:45.770 --> 00:19:47.280
Let's go then, Sayo.

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:48.130
Yes.

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:13.980
Quiet. I'm not responsible for
what happens if you struggle.

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:16.900
Miss Ruri!

00:20:18.630 --> 00:20:21.220
If you make a fuss, I'll punch
her right in the face.

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:22.250
And you, too.

00:20:22.940 --> 00:20:24.110
Y-You...

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:37.810
What are you doing?

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:39.250
Crap.

00:20:53.170 --> 00:20:56.620
St...op...

00:20:57.720 --> 00:20:59.070
Stop?

00:21:13.740 --> 00:21:14.860
Sir Rio...

00:21:15.980 --> 00:21:17.960
Sir Rio, stop!

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:20.300
This is bad!

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:25.630
Sir Rio! Cease! If you hit
him any more, he'll die!

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:36.590
Is that Gon?

00:21:36.590 --> 00:21:40.310
It seems he was trying to assault
Lady Ruri and Lady Sayo.

00:21:40.310 --> 00:21:41.570
I'll handle this.

00:21:41.870 --> 00:21:43.420
Lady Yuba, please see to the two of them.

00:21:43.420 --> 00:21:45.020
Ruri, Sayo, come with me.

00:21:48.900 --> 00:21:52.080
Am I correct in that you lot are
the ones who caused this uproar?

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:54.100
Y...es...

00:21:54.100 --> 00:21:56.160
You have committed a grave crime.

00:21:56.590 --> 00:21:59.130
I seek punishment from the kingdom.
Send a messenger!

00:21:59.460 --> 00:22:00.170
Yes, sir!

00:22:05.590 --> 00:22:08.890
This is the second time I've
wanted to kill someone.

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:12.830
As Rio, I've had this feeling
inside me all this time.

00:22:14.610 --> 00:22:15.580
But...

00:22:16.560 --> 00:22:18.160
without me noticing,

00:22:18.580 --> 00:22:20.960
I've been pulled closer to Amakawa Haruto.

00:22:22.750 --> 00:22:25.400
I turned my eyes away from my revenge.

00:22:26.010 --> 00:22:27.280
Even though, in the end, I...

00:22:28.840 --> 00:22:32.060
I'm the same sort of person as that man.

00:22:39.230 --> 00:22:41.660
Tomorrow morning, a messenger
from the kingdom will arrive.

00:22:41.660 --> 00:22:44.220
They've decided that Gon and the
others will be taken into custody.

00:22:45.500 --> 00:22:46.430
Everyone.

00:22:47.280 --> 00:22:51.890
I caused you such trouble yesterday.
I can't apologize enough.

00:22:51.890 --> 00:22:56.400
You have nothing to apologize for.
Thank you for protecting Ruri and Sayo.

00:22:57.130 --> 00:23:01.390
Yeah. It's only because you arrived
so quickly that I was safe.

00:23:01.390 --> 00:23:05.900
Sir Rio, it was only because you wanted
to protect us that you got so angry!

00:23:06.430 --> 00:23:10.410
If you hadn't hit him, Sir Rio, I would have.

00:23:11.290 --> 00:23:14.160
Everyone... thank you so much.

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:17.890
But, please... let me apologize
just one more time.

00:23:17.890 --> 00:23:19.660
You're so serious.

00:23:20.010 --> 00:23:22.350
Just like a certain someone.

00:23:22.690 --> 00:23:23.740
Who?

00:23:23.740 --> 00:23:25.740
Well, let's have breakfast.

00:23:25.740 --> 00:23:27.930
Sir Rio, I'm hungry!

00:23:27.930 --> 00:23:30.170
Yeah. Let's hurry and eat!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
Next Time

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
Royal Lineage

00:23:36.950 --> 00:23:38.460
"Royal Lineage."
